# Reversal Mountain's slopes (a volcano's warm rock under a wide sky, cyclists on its tracks): an oboe tune in E minor over a
# string pad, a marimba arpeggio that rolls like a pebble down the slope, a steady bass and a dry beat. Original composition for
# this game (plan 22 · U7, part b).
